1441
01:41:10,505 --> 01:41:13,381
Kau kebanggaan spesiesmu, Teddy.

1442
01:41:13,464 --> 01:41:15,988
Aku cuma mencoba membantu.

1443
01:41:17,903 --> 01:41:20,084
